    ("手续费由你自己付，用 USDC 付，不需要 ETH：从你的 Coinbase 账户里的 USDC 扣，确认窗口会显示准确金额。Kipurse 不出钱、不代付。", "You pay this network fee yourself, in USDC (no ETH needed), from your Coinbase account (Coinbase wallet); the signing window shows the exact amount. Kipurse pays nothing."),
