    ("这一步要把这台手机的钥匙写进你在区块链上的钱包（给钱包加一个确认人）。这是一笔链上交易，要付一次手续费，按实际花费从你的启付钱包 USDC 里扣，不加价、没有最低收费，最多 0.05 USDC，只付这一次。手续费付给区块链网络，Kipurse 不收一分钱。", "This step writes this phone's key into your wallet on the blockchain (it adds a signer to your wallet). That is an on-chain transaction, so it costs a one-time network fee at actual cost, paid from your Kipurse wallet's USDC (no markup, no minimum, at most 0.05 USDC). The fee goes to the blockchain network; Kipurse takes nothing."),
