    ("这是给旧版手机确认的一次性升级，手续费用你钱包里的 USDC 付。Siri 付款不需要升级：付款上限内直接付，超出时推送到手机用 Face ID 批准。不升级也不影响 Face ID：批准新收款方、超出上限的付款、恢复 AI 付款照样能用。手机钥匙不能转走你的钱，也不能提高上限。", "This is a one-time upgrade for an older phone signer; the network fee is paid from your wallet's USDC. Siri payments are free and don't need it: within your payment limit Siri pays, otherwise you get a Face ID request on this phone. Without it, Face ID still works: approving new payees, payments over the limit and resuming AI payments. The phone key can't move your money or raise your limits."),
    ("为什么 Claude、Grok、Muse、Siri 等 AI 连接不收费？连接 AI 只是在我们的服务器上做一次授权，不上区块链，没有手续费。它们付款时照样受你设的额度和规则约束。", "Why are Claude, Grok, Muse, Siri and other AIs free to connect? Connecting an AI is only an authorization on our server: nothing goes on the blockchain, so there's no network fee. Their payments still follow your limits and rules."),
